<mj-section background-color="#0B1624" padding-top="0" padding-bottom="0">
	<mj-column>
		<mj-text font-family="Helvetica" color="#F45E43" padding-top="0">
			<h3 style="font-family:Calibri,Roboto, Lato, Avenir Next, Verdana, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 24px;  color: #ffffff; margin: 0;">
				Codecamp Day  
			</h3>
			<p
				style="
					font-family:
						Calibri,
						Roboto,
						Lato,
						Avenir Next,
						Verdana,
						Helvetica,
						Arial,
						sans-serif;
					font-size: 16px;
					line-height: 24px;
					color: #ffffff;
				"
			>
				Our colleague Maria Teodorescu recently attended <a href="https://codecamp.ro/codecamps/bucharest-2026/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ffffff;">Codecamp Day</a>, a tech-focused event that brought together industry professionals for a full day of technical insights, discussions on software architecture, AI, leadership, and emerging trends in the IT industry.  
				<br /><br />
				After the event, she also hosted an internal knowledge-sharing session for the team, where she shared some of the most interesting ideas and key takeaways from the conference.  For those who couldn’t join or would like to revisit the discussion, you can find the presentation and session recap,<a href="https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetingrecap?driveId=b%21MHvUcSFwW0uQvKkhoJvOxAZqk6zHMVlPlUHKZyBX_6DXClDWF8TYR7uwocjzuCec&driveItemId=0175FOAS6PYX4CWEORRBHKYDB2T74E2WGH&sitePath=https%3A%2F%2Fddroidd-my.sharepoint.com%2F%3Av%3A%2Fp%2Fovidiu_hretcanu%2FIQDPxfgrEdGITqwMOp_4TVjHAQA1P4YKnkZFDFH7M0mKTHA&fileUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fddroidd-my.sharepoint.com%2F%3Av%3A%2Fp%2Fovidiu_hretcanu%2FIQDPxfgrEdGITqwMOp_4TVjHAQA1P4YKnkZFDFH7M0mKTHA&iCalUid=040000008200E00074C5B7101A82E00807EA05133D4283E2B8D0DC010000000000000000100000002EEDEB979985B84D83758FD829CD1C62&masterICalUid=040000008200E00074C5B7101A82E008000000003D4283E2B8D0DC010000000000000000100000002EEDEB979985B84D83758FD829CD1C62&threadId=19%3Ameeting_ZmZmMGRkOGItMGU2ZS00NDY4LWJiY2YtNWRiMGYyNmEzZjlm%40thread.v2&organizerId=f75b7063-e31d-4be0-b82c-c445320e4045&tenantId=6077bcee-1104-4119-bc98-539870c66eef&callId=78d71533-9cca-4377-a246-a4d06add620e&threadType=Meeting&meetingType=Recurring&subType=RecapSharingLink_RecapChiclet" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ffffff;"> here</a> 
				<br /><br />
				We are happy to see colleagues engaging with external tech events and bringing back fresh insights to share with the team. If there are conferences or industry events you believe could bring value to the team, we encourage you to discuss them with your Discipline Leads and explore together whether they could be a good fit. 
			</p>
		</mj-text>
